# The Gustaberg Tour (bastok 45): Izabele in the Metalworks, Hunting Bear in North Gustaberg. The offer 745 (no guard),
# Izabele's 746, Hunting Bear's 21 (a party of 2 or more, every alliance member at level 15 or below and within 15
# yalms, would play 22 instead), then, set completed by a GM, 23 and Izabele's 747 (both replaceDefault). Izabele's
# default is 745 too, Hunting Bear's 20; no other quest or mission names either. The char is level 10 and alone.
# 22 and its finish (the completion) need a party of two or more: #party plays them (and #era with the era module).
lists Metalworks/Izabele/onTrigger Metalworks/Izabele/onTrade NorthGustaberg/Hunting_Bear/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/745 NorthGustaberg/onEventFinish/22
char zone=Metalworks pos=-44.5,-10,-4.7
item BoneChip
login
trade Izabele BoneChip x1      # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Izabele                # available: the offer, 745
finish                         # accepted
trigger Izabele                # accepted: 746
finish
trade Izabele BoneChip x1      # accepted: no trade handler, nothing
warp -233.9,41.465,426.5 NorthGustaberg
trigger Hunting_Bear           # level 10, alone (a party of one): 21
finish
quest Bastok.TheGustabergTour completed
trigger Hunting_Bear           # completed: 23
finish
warp -44.5,-10,-4.7 Metalworks
trigger Izabele                # completed: 747
finish
